{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEEPEST WELL DEMO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deepest Well <strong>Demo</strong> is a roguelike wave shooter inspired by Seraph's Last Stand, designed around creating synergistic builds to potentially break the game with crazy combinations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Choose your upgrades wisely and stack them up to achieve <strong>Ascensions!</strong></u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983840/extras/ec1a6c5957b1ce8d3973b4479904fee2.poster.avif?t=1756916970\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983840/extras/ec1a6c5957b1ce8d3973b4479904fee2.webm?t=1756916970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983840/extras/ec1a6c5957b1ce8d3973b4479904fee2.mp4?t=1756916970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Destructible terrain!</u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983840/extras/4d23ec208e0fad366b232b5b3f0fb0ad.poster.avif?t=1756916970\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983840/extras/4d23ec208e0fad366b232b5b3f0fb0ad.webm?t=1756916970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983840/extras/4d23ec208e0fad366b232b5b3f0fb0ad.mp4?t=1756916970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Combine cards and create your awesome game-breaking build!</u></p></li></